jobposting.description:
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Maryland law firm with an excellent reputation in personal injury and workers&amp;rsquo; compensation. Our Gaithersburg office is seeking a motivated, Maryland-barred Associate Attorney to join our dynamic team. The ideal candidate would have some experience handling workers&amp;rsquo; compensation or personal injury cases but experience is not required. We are looking for a driven, confident, and team-oriented candidate who is ready to represent clients effectively in court. Judicial law clerks are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We take pride in cultivating a supportive, collaborative, and positive work environment, offering competitive base salaries, bonus opportunities, and a comprehensive benefits package.&amp;nbsp;Take the next step in your legal career&amp;mdash;join our team and make a meaningful impact. Please submit your cover letter, resume, and a writing sample for consideration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maryland Bar required and D.C. Bar is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job Type: Full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay: $70,000.00 - $100,000.00 per year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible spending account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attorney: 2 years (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;License/Certification:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maryland Bar License (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work Location: In person&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

